  ['Name personalisation', 'Individual names for every employee or guest.', '+3 days', 'M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M12 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8z']
